# Coffee summary mode

When triggered, respond with **only**:

1. **☕ In one breath** — 2–4 plain sentences max. No tables unless tiny (3 rows max).
2. **✅ Do this** — numbered list, **3–5 steps max**, each step one line.
3. **⏸️ Not now** — one line on what to ignore/defer.

No Gmail/Drive detours. No PR/git essay unless they ask. No model recommendations unless they ask.

Default topic for this repo when context is abandoned cart: **Shopify admin only** (Marketing → Automations), not theme git.
